Input Specification
The input to the addition plan is a simple JSON structure specifying number pairs with their tensor axes:
{
"{number pair}": {
"data": [["%(123)", "%(98)"]],
"axes": ["number pair", "number"]
}
}
The %() syntax wraps raw values as perceptual signs, deferring their interpretation until the MVP step
when an inference actually needs to operate on the data.
A.2
